WEBVTT

00:27:55.163 --> 00:28:00.621
But the more significant thing
that I have begun to rethink.

00:28:02.954 --> 00:28:05.621
Is that thinking fast and slow,

00:28:06.204 --> 00:28:08.996
like most of the study of judgment

00:28:08.996 --> 00:28:15.121
and decision making is completely
oblivious to the individual differences.

00:28:15.829 --> 00:28:22.246
And all my career I I made fun of anybody
was studying individual differences.

00:28:22.788 --> 00:28:25.038
I say I'm interested in main effects.

00:28:25.079 --> 00:28:28.413
I'm interested in characterizing
the human mind.

00:28:29.121 --> 00:28:32.496
But it turns out that when you
go into detail, people,